WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Open your online store in three steps. Get paid by MoMo or card through your own Paystack account.

00:03.000 --> 00:09.000
Step 1: design your store. Type a store name and pick what you sell and a colour.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.000
Add your first product and its price. The preview updates as you type.

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000
Your store is ready. Create an account to save it.

00:16.000 --> 00:21.000
Step 2: connect Paystack. Paste your public and secret keys from Paystack, under Settings, API keys.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.000
Customers pay with MoMo or card, through Paystack, straight into your account.

00:25.000 --> 00:28.000
Step 3: publish your store and share the link on WhatsApp.

00:28.000 --> 00:33.500
A customer opens your store, orders, and pays with Mobile Money.

00:33.500 --> 00:39.000
You're told the moment the order is paid, and it shows on your dashboard.

00:39.000 --> 00:44.000
Start selling today. Design your store first, and create an account only when you like it.
